{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach it. Then, grasp object and perform task. If object lost, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <Action ID = MoveToTaskLocation    /> <Action ID = ReturnObjectToOriginalLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInGripper    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = WanderTask    />",
